OL,3,AAI will cure cancer in our lifetime,
OL,4,Aclaims boss of UK chip giant
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaas also told the BBC that AI would
OL,7,Flead to widespread humanoid robots in
OL,8,Fthe next five years, but that its
OL,9,Fcurrent rapid growth was being held up
OL,10,Fby a shortage of chips needed to build
OL,11,Fdata centres.
OL,13,FHowever, he was sceptical about the
OL,14,Fidea chips could be manufactured in the
OL,15,FUK in the future.
